.\" Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), supplementary DWARF attachment API.
.Dd October 8, 2026
.Dt DWARF_SET_TIED_DBG 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm dwarf_set_tied_dbg
.Nd attach caller-owned supplementary DWARF data
.Sh LIBRARY
.Lb libdwarf
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In libdwarf.h
.Ft int
.Fn dwarf_set_tied_dbg "Dwarf_Debug dbg" "Dwarf_Debug tied" "Dwarf_Error *error"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The function associates the supplementary debug object
.Fa tied
with
.Fa dbg .
.Fn dwarf_formstring
uses its string section for
.Dv DW_FORM_strp_sup .
The caller must validate the ELF identity and matching
.Pa .debug_sup
metadata before attaching it.
.Fn dwarf_global_formref
returns supplementary reference offsets without rebasing them into the
main object; the caller must resolve those offsets in the supplementary object.
.Pp
No ownership is transferred.
Keep
.Fa tied
alive until all accesses through
.Fa dbg
are complete.
Passing NULL as
.Fa tied
detaches the association.
Self-attachment, nested attachments and architecture/address-size mismatches
are rejected.
This API does not automatically search files or implement a DWP index.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns
.Dv DW_DLV_OK
on success, or
.Dv DW_DLV_ERROR
with
.Dv DW_DLE_ARGUMENT
for an invalid association.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dwarf_elf_init 3 ,
.Xr dwarf_formstring 3 ,
.Xr dwarf_global_formref 3
